<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Ocean Irene - 180,000 tones coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam Dec $6.25 fio scale load/25,000 shinc Cobelfret.</p>
<p>ORE - Esplanade - 130,000 tonnes Tuburao/Beilun 20/11-5/12 $9.95 fio scale load/15,000 shex Eastern Rich/CSG.</p>
<p>Jean LD - 130,000 tonnes Seven Islands/Antwerp 1-15/12 $4.75 fio six days shinc Cockerill.</p>
<p>TBN 45,000 tonnes bauxite Trombetas/Corpus Christi 20-26/11 $8.25 fio seven days D'Amato.</p>
<p>There were no fixtures reported from New York on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
